   "body_html": "<blockquote>\n  <p>But the error is: \"Allocation/deallocation type mismatch\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>That's because you allocate an array, but deallocate a single object.</p>\n\n<pre><code>TEST(MyTestGroup, TestAdd_1)\n{\n    p = Add(); // the above function\n    delete[] p; // &lt;--- Use correct delete for arrays\n}\n</code></pre>\n"
  }
